    {
      "id": "7cde12eb-d389-56b4-bf9f-94058dbfa1ac",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "감독님 혹시 시간 괜찮으세요?\n지난 경기 제 플레이 어땠는지 궁금해서요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Coach, do you have a minute?\nI wanted to know how I played last match.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6000e424-1b24-59c9-93d0-07234cca1f44",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "면담 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "7cde12eb-d389-56b4-bf9f-94058dbfa1ac"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "c456618b-9b95-52fd-8a00-03dfbc178fdd": "interview",
        "4bbdfb50-ae04-51f6-834f-3a12f3989e46": -1,
        "987c265d-29ec-5bbf-930f-5b52417e7596": 0,
        "8ab2d545-a8f2-59d8-b4ec-0d2e58719200": "",
        "85a71a13-aa24-572f-b53b-604f1694fc4c": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f2264c03-482c-5c4b-9f01-76c3e4eda288",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "7463f431-edcd-5f0f-a0fc-ec07dab2838e",
          "text": "침착했어. 그대로만 가자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "4c9b95c9-4a7b-56bc-9e38-d28ab9332995": "trust:+3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "6bf23fdd-03cb-5b4f-8109-cacc1dfda609",
          "text": "몇 군데 아쉬웠어. 같이 영상 보자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "4c9b95c9-4a7b-56bc-9e38-d28ab9332995": "ok>trust:+6;ng>trust:+1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "5eafc901-abcc-5fcd-9cf9-fbd3722b6c5c",
          "text": "결과로 말하면 되지.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "4c9b95c9-4a7b-56bc-9e38-d28ab9332995": "trust:-2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:7463f431-edcd-5f0f-a0fc-ec07dab2838e": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You were composed. Keep it up.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:6bf23fdd-03cb-5b4f-8109-cacc1dfda609": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "A few spots could be better. Let's watch the VOD together.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:5eafc901-abcc-5fcd-9cf9-fbd3722b6c5c": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let your results do the talking.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f2f4ff71-dec7-5d37-b3b6-4e0b32bb18b7",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": -220.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "다행이다. 계속 그렇게 해 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Phew. I'll keep doing it that way.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d0098040-089a-546f-a2ad-e34851a91772",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "같이 봐 주시는 거예요? 좋아요!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You'll watch it with me? Awesome!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "dfe50035-a3d4-5431-89c0-4844c7cb6937": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "87073241-e1e1-592a-a53c-a3348f46030c",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네… 지적만 듣는 건 좀 힘드네요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay… just getting criticized is kind of hard.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "dfe50035-a3d4-5431-89c0-4844c7cb6937": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "def38b81-7393-5b76-aae3-3bc3f73036c2",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 300.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…네.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…Okay.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
